  DialogueNodeData:
  - Guid: 6d139e9a-dcc1-45f7-9d19-e9ed9c266c02
    DialogueText: '*Gasp* ...'
    Position: {x: 187, y: 200}
  - Guid: 1281d269-c11f-48a1-8183-91f0875a904d
    DialogueText: Oh yes, my child. I am fine. The better question is, are you?
    Position: {x: 504, y: 52}
  - Guid: 650dc299-cb60-4f79-8a06-72233177f086
    DialogueText: Oh... It's nothing, my child. Tell me, have you been feeling okay
      as of late?
    Position: {x: 504, y: 209}
  - Guid: 3d40753c-64da-4357-8c83-93f5344c57da
    DialogueText: My apologies, child. Tell me... Have you been feeling okay as of
      late?
    Position: {x: 505, y: 374}
  - Guid: e31f0bb2-cf21-4e52-a89d-91dc0d25d9c4
    DialogueText: Are you sure...?
    Position: {x: 1109, y: 49}
  - Guid: 94966c1d-d873-40e1-9ae3-07e55d209f90
    DialogueText: Very well... But are you sure that you're feeling well? Nothing
      feels wrong?
    Position: {x: 1108, y: 214}
  - Guid: c6d5da48-58f5-455b-95d2-29176a75c75d
    DialogueText: No, that's not it. I sense something far more... sinister.
    Position: {x: 1669, y: 43}
  - Guid: c4855537-f2a1-4f87-9c7a-cad626b9a2c5
    DialogueText: Hmm... Perhaps it has not yet begun.
    Position: {x: 1668, y: 210}
  - Guid: ac21741c-f8d1-4609-88a8-bfb5dfaa062e
    DialogueText: 'I don''t wish to pry, but I would be remiss to not try to intervene
      and save you from your fate. '
    Position: {x: 1667, y: 372}
  - Guid: 1a936d76-6a21-4823-8cea-5f178c0ff189
    DialogueText: Nothing feels... off?
    Position: {x: 1110, y: 377}
  - Guid: af93f235-b8f3-472c-bb2e-e406e04328c8
    DialogueText: A darkness has consumed your future. Tell me, have you called your
      parents recently?
    Position: {x: 2455, y: 45}
  - Guid: 51d1be4c-03cd-4c57-9b0e-b028c1d6887d
    DialogueText: Angle? I assure you, I have no angle. I'm only trying to help.
      Tell me, have you called your parents recently?
    Position: {x: 2482, y: 212}
  - Guid: ed6c6f38-4f65-4e43-8166-16f525b9d881
    DialogueText: Tell me... Have you called your parents recently?
    Position: {x: 2490, y: 395}
  - Guid: 445d820a-059d-4bf9-8c8f-435d12a08ef0
    DialogueText: How sad. Perhaps you should reach out to them? I'm sure they would
      appreciate hearing from you one last time.
    Position: {x: 3306, y: 174}
  - Guid: 301c581f-4662-4457-9959-b5f6686b82b2
    DialogueText: I'm sure they would just appreciate hearing from you one last time.
    Position: {x: 3346, y: 8}
  - Guid: acdf42cf-919c-4b84-85af-8790e0dcd2a1
    DialogueText: For the time being. That's the funny thing about the future, it's
      always changing.
    Position: {x: 4122, y: -2}
  - Guid: 5714187d-37b2-4742-85de-ed40f1ad5a14
    DialogueText: Perhaps I've said too much...
    Position: {x: 4144, y: 373}
  - Guid: 7ce00f99-aefb-473e-9e19-97f311d6521d
    DialogueText: Well you really should. I'm sure they would appreciate hearing
      from you one last time.
    Position: {x: 3250, y: 361}
  - Guid: e1bf4905-0fd5-4661-b991-e5028e517db6
    DialogueText: I'll take your silence as worry that I am right. When fate calls,
      I hope you are ready.
    Position: {x: 4148, y: 197}
  ExposedProperties: []
  CommentBlockData: []
